<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SENS.LAB | 배그 감도 추천</title>
    <style>
         :root {
            --bg: #0b0d12;
            --text: #eef1f6;
            --sub: #8e98aa;
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, .045);
            --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, .09);
            --a1: #ffb703;
            --a2: #fb5607;
            --grad: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--a1), var(--a2));
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        html {
            scroll-behavior: auto;
        }
        /* 부드러운 이동은 아래 JS(easing)가 담당 */
        
        body {
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: "Malgun Gothic", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.65;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        
        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        /* 배경 장식 */
        
        .bg {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: -1;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .bg::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 56px 56px;
            opacity: .35;
            mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 20%, #000 20%, transparent 75%);
        }
        
        .blob {
            position: absolute;
            width: 520px;
            height: 520px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(110px);
            opacity: .35;
            animation: float 14s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        .b1 {
            background: var(--a2);
            top: -160px;
            left: -120px;
        }
        
        .b2 {
            background: var(--a1);
            top: 30%;
            right: -180px;
            animation-delay: -6s;
            opacity: .22;
        }
        
        @keyframes float {
            50% {
                transform: translate(60px, 50px) scale(1.12);
            }
        }
        /* 상단 메뉴 */
        
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            z-index: 50;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 16px 6vw;
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            background: rgba(11, 13, 18, .6);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        
        .logo {
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 21px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .logo span,
        .grad {
            background: var(--grad);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        
        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
        }
        
        nav ul a {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--sub);
            transition: .2s;
        }
        
        nav ul a {
            position: relative;
        }
        
        nav ul a::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            bottom: -6px;
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--grad);
            transform: scaleX(0);
            transform-origin: left;
            transition: transform .35s ease;
        }
        
        nav ul a:hover {
            color: #fff;
        }
        
        nav ul a.active {
            color: #fff;
        }
        
        nav ul a.active::after,
        nav ul a:hover::after {
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }
        /* 히어로 */
        
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 120px 6vw 60px;
        }
        
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--glass);
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--a1);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 26px;
        }
        
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 78px);
            line-height: 1.15;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        
        .hero p {
            max-width: 560px;
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px);
            margin: 22px auto 36px;
        }
        
        .btns {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .btn {
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: .25s;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .btn.pri {
            background: var(--grad);
            color: #111;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(251, 86, 7, .35);
        }
        
        .btn.pri:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(251, 86, 7, .5);
        }
        
        .btn.ghost {
            background: var(--glass);
            color: var(--text);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        
        .btn.ghost:hover {
            border-color: var(--a1);
        }
        
        .stats {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 64px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .stats div b {
            display: block;
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }
        
        .stats div span {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--sub);
        }
        /* 첫 화면 순차 등장 */
        
        .hero>* {
            opacity: 0;
            animation: rise .9s cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1) forwards;
        }
        
        .hero>*:nth-child(2) {
            animation-delay: .12s;
        }
        
        .hero>*:nth-child(3) {
            animation-delay: .24s;
        }
        
        .hero>*:nth-child(4) {
            animation-delay: .36s;
        }
        
        .hero>*:nth-child(5) {
            animation-delay: .48s;
        }
        
        @keyframes rise {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(26px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: none;
            }
        }
        
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .hero>* {
                animation: none;
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }
        /* 공통 섹션 */
        
        section.s {
            max-width: 960px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 80px 6vw;
        }
        
        .tag {
            color: var(--a1);
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .s h2 {
            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px);
            margin: 8px 0 28px;
        }
        
        .glass {
            background: var(--glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 26px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        /* ===== 이벤트 슬라이드 (10초마다 자동 전환) ===== */
        
        .stage {
            position: relative;
            height: 340px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: var(--glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        
        .slide {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            padding: 38px 42px 56px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateX(40px);
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 28%, transparent), transparent 60%);
        }
        
        .slide.active {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: none;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }
        
        .slide .top {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .pill {
            padding: 4px 13px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: 1px solid var(--c);
            color: var(--c);
        }
        
        .pill.solid {
            background: var(--c);
            color: #111;
        }
        
        .slide h3 {
            font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 34px);
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        
        .slide p {
            color: #c3cbd8;
            max-width: 640px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        
        .slide .meta {
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 18px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--sub);
        }
        
        .slide .cd {
            color: var(--c);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }
        
        .slide .btn {
            margin-top: 20px;
            align-self: flex-start;
            padding: 11px 26px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        
        .ctrl {
            position: absolute;
            right: 18px;
            bottom: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            z-index: 3;
        }
        
        .ctrl button {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .4);
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: .2s;
        }
        
        .ctrl button:hover {
            border-color: var(--a1);
            color: var(--a1);
        }
        
        .count {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--sub);
            min-width: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .dots {
            position: absolute;
            left: 42px;
            bottom: 22px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            z-index: 3;
        }
        
        .dots i {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .2);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: .3s;
        }
        
        .dots i.on {
            width: 26px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: var(--a1);
        }
        
        .bar {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            height: 4px;
            width: 0;
            background: var(--grad);
            z-index: 3;
        }
        
        .paused {
            position: absolute;
            top: 16px;
            right: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--sub);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: .2s;
            z-index: 3;
        }
        
        .stage:hover .paused {
            opacity: 1;
        }
        /* 이벤트 목록 */
        
        .lists {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }
        
        .lists h4 {
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .ev {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .ev:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        
        .ev .nm {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        
        .ev .nm::before {
            content: "";
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--c);
            flex: none;
        }
        
        .ev .cd {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        
        .none {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 14px;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }
        /* 입력 */
        
        .row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .field {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 170px;
        }
        
        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--sub);
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        
        input,
        select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .35);
            color: var(--text);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: .2s;
        }
        
        input:focus,
        select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--a1);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 183, 3, .18);
        }
        
        select option {
            background: #14171f;
        }
        
        .chips {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }
        
        .chip {
            padding: 9px 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--sub);
        }
        
        .chip b {
            color: var(--a1);
        }
        /* 결과 카드 */
        
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 22px;
        }
        
        .rc {
            padding: 20px 12px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: var(--glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            transition: .3s;
        }
        
        .rc:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            border-color: var(--a1);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(255, 183, 3, .14);
        }
        
        .rc small {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--sub);
        }
        
        .rc strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin: 4px 0 2px;
            background: var(--grad);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        
        .rc em {
            font-style: normal;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--sub);
            display: block;
            min-height: 18px;
        }
        
        .rc em.chg {
            color: var(--a1);
        }
        
        .rc .rg {
            padding: 0;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: none;
            accent-color: var(--a1);
            margin: 12px 0 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        .pm {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .pm button {
            width: 34px;
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .35);
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: .2s;
        }
        
        .pm button:hover {
            border-color: var(--a1);
            color: var(--a1);
        }
        
        .pm button:active {
            transform: scale(.92);
        }
        
        .note {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        /* 보정 테이블 */
        
        .tw {
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }
        
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            min-width: 560px;
        }
        
        th,
        td {
            padding: 11px 8px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        th {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-weight: normal;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        td:first-child,
        th:first-child {
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        td input {
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .res {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--a1);
        }
        /* 사용법 */
        
        .steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
        }
        
        .step {
            padding: 26px;
        }
        
        .step i {
            font-style: normal;
            display: inline-flex;
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--grad);
            color: #111;
            font-weight: 900;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        
        .step h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        
        .step p {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 40px 16px 56px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        /* 스크롤 등장 효과 */
        
        .reveal {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(28px);
            transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;
        }
        
        .reveal.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: none;
        }
        
        @media (max-width:760px) {
            nav ul {
                gap: 14px;
            }
            nav ul a {
                font-size: 13px;
            }
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .steps,
            .lists {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .stats {
                gap: 26px;
            }
            .stage {
                height: 400px;
            }
            .slide {
                padding: 30px 22px 60px;
            }
            .dots {
                left: 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="bg">
        <div class="blob b1"></div>
        <div class="blob b2"></div>
    </div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#top" class="logo">SENS<span>.LAB</span></a>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#events">이벤트</a></li>
            <li><a href="#calc">추천</a></li>
            <li><a href="#fix">보정</a></li>
            <li><a href="#guide">사용법</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- 히어로 -->
    <header class="hero" id="top">
        <span class="badge">PUBG SENSITIVITY</span>
        <h1>나에게 딱 맞는<br><span class="grad">배그 감도</span>를 찾아라</h1>
        <p>DPI와 에임 스타일만 입력하면 배율별 시작 감도를 바로 알려드려요. 이후 직접 측정해서 더 정확하게 맞춰보세요.</p>
        <div class="btns">
            <a href="#calc" class="btn pri">감도 추천받기</a>
            <a href="#events" class="btn ghost">진행 중 이벤트</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
            <div><b class="grad">7</b><span>배율별 조정</span></div>
            <div><b class="grad">30~45</b><span>목표 cm/360°</span></div>
            <div><b class="grad">10초</b><span>이벤트 자동 전환</span></div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 이벤트 (자동 슬라이드) -->
    <section class="s reveal" id="events">
        <span class="tag">LIVE EVENTS</span>
        <h2>지금 진행 중인 이벤트</h2>

        <div class="stage" id="stage">
            <div id="slides"></div>
            <span class="paused">⏸ 마우스를 올리면 일시정지</span>
            <div class="dots" id="dots"></div>
            <div class="ctrl">
                <button type="button" id="prev" aria-label="이전">◀</button>
                <span class="count" id="count">1 / 1</span>
                <button type="button" id="next" aria-label="다음">▶</button>
            </div>
            <div class="bar" id="bar"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="glass lists" style="margin-top:18px">
            <div>
                <h4>🔥 진행 중</h4>
                <div id="listOn"></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>⏰ 예정</h4>
                <div id="listSoon"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="note">※ 이벤트 일정은 직접 입력한 데이터(2026.11.18 기준)라 점검·사정에 따라 바뀔 수 있어요. 정확한 내용은 공식 공지를 확인하세요.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- 추천 -->
    <section class="s reveal" id="calc">
        <span class="tag">STEP 01</span>
        <h2>내 설정으로 추천받기</h2>
        <div class="glass">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="field">
                    <label for="dpi">마우스 DPI</label>
                    <input type="number" id="dpi" value="800" min="100" max="6400" step="50">
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                    <label for="style">에임 스타일</label>
                    <select id="style">
          <option value="0.85">팔 위주 (저감도)</option>
          <option value="1" selected>혼합 (손목+팔)</option>
          <option value="1.15">손목 위주 (고감도)</option>
        </select>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chips">
                <div class="chip">일반 감도 <b id="gsens">-</b></div>
                <div class="chip">eDPI <b id="edpi">-</b></div>
                <div class="chip">목표 <b>약 30~45 cm/360°</b></div>
                <div class="chip">수직 배율 <b>1.00</b></div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
            <button type="button" class="btn pri" id="copyBtn" style="margin-top:22px">결과 복사</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="resetBtn" style="margin-top:22px; margin-left:8px">조정 초기화</button>
            <p class="note">※ 슬라이더나 − + 버튼으로 배율별 감도를 직접 조정할 수 있어요. 추천값은 시작값(근사치)이라, 배율마다 체감이 달라 직접 측정해 보정하는 게 가장 정확해요.</p>
